CIPHER // BREACH
            FOR LEVEL 1
A console based C++ game where you decrypt secret words hidden with a Caesar Cipher.
HOW TO PLAY A GAME (LEVEL 1)
Run the program. The title screen appears and MISSSION 01 starts.
A Cipher word is shown for example: KHOOR.
Shift each letter backward by 3 to find the original word (KHOOR --> HELLO).
Type your answer and press Enter( upper or lower case both work)
You start with 3 lives and 30 points.
Each wrong answer costs 1 life and 10 points.
A correct answer completes the mission.
At the end type yes to play again or no to quit.
